dkms: dkms (Dynamic Kernel Module Support)
dkms:
dkms: Dynamic Kernel Module Support is a framework for automatically
dkms: rebuilding out-of-tree kernel modules when a new kernel is installed.
dkms: Most kernel modules registered with DKMS will be rebuilt when the
dkms: machine is rebooted with the new kernel. For special cases, the
dkms: modules are rebuilt when geninitrd is run so that they will be
dkms: available when the machine is rebooted.
dkms:
dkms: Homepage: https://github.com/dell/dkms
